      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: a_local_market; hasOverallIntent: Overall Intent; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a bustling local market scene, likely in Turkey, with vendors wearing red shirts featuring the Turkish flag and serving ice cream cones to customers. The text overlay 'a local market' is generic and descriptive, serving to label the setting. There is no evidence of abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda intent. The scene is presented neutrally, capturing a common cultural or tourist experience without targeting any specific group or promoting harmful stereotypes. The intent is to document or share a slice of local life, possibly for travel, cultural, or commercial purposes, without any toxic or discriminatory messaging.",
