      "label": "the scene is labeled as a local market",
      "description": "The text overlay 'a local market' is positioned over the image to label the entire scene. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual material (the bustling market scene with vendors and customers) is mapped onto the textual description 'a local market'. The text serves to categorize or identify the visual content as a local market, establishing a direct semantic link between the text and the visual entities present (e.g., the vendor, customers, ice cream cones, Turkish flag, Coca-Cola refrigerator).",
